      "basis": {
        "kinds": [
          "measured-prior",
          "requirement"
        ],
        "cite": "`5 × V2 changed-mode p99@32 × events/h + 1,800 commits/h × 5 ms`. W1 uses redraw-unchanged (2.446 ms), W4/W5 typing-sparse (0.513 ms), W3 scroll-dense (2.754 ms), W6 redraw-unchanged. W7 = W4 + 5 × 240 × 3.11 ms. W8 = W1 + 7 s scanner allowance (requirement). W9 = W4 + 28,800 × 5 ms (requirement). W2 is a requirement.",
        "derivation": "5 x p99 x events/h + 1,800 commits/h x 5 ms (= 9 s; the 5 ms per commit is an allowance). W1: 5 x 2.446 ms x 3,600 = 44.03 + 9 = 53.03 -> 53. W3: 5 x 2.754 ms x 72,000 = 991.44 + 9 = 1,000.44 -> 1000. W4: 5 x 0.513 ms x 24,000 = 61.56 + 9 = 70.56 -> 71. W5: 5 x 0.513 ms x 36,000 = 92.34 + 9 = 101.34 -> 101. W6: 5 x 2.446 ms x 14,400 = 176.11 + 9 = 185.11 -> 185. W7: 71 + 5 x 240 x 3.11 ms = 71 + 3.73 = 74.73 -> 75. W8: 53 + 7 = 60 (7 s scanner allowance is a requirement). W9: 71 + 28,800 x 5 ms = 71 + 144 = 215 (activity allowance is a requirement). W2: requirement."
      }
